        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sam Mendes, Ruby Yang, Jennifer Worth, Pippa Harris, Caro Newling\n- Organizations: Neal Street Productions, BBC One\n- Works: Call the Midwife\n- Roles: stage director, film director, producer, executive producer, filmmaker\n\nFacts:\n- Sam Mendes, born on 1 August 1965, is an English stage and film director.\n- Ruby Yang is a Chinese American filmmaker.\n- Neal Street Productions was founded and is owned by Sam Mendes, Pippa Harris, and Caro Newling.\n- Pippa Harris is an executive producer of Call the Midwife.\n- Call the Midwife is produced by Neal Street Productions.\n- Call the Midwife is a television series based on Jennifer Worth's books.\n- Call the Midwife began broadcasting on BBC One on 15 January 2012.",
